sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Notebook
    participant Exp as AI4RAGExperiment
    participant HPO as GAM Optimizer
    participant Docling as Docling Chunker
    participant MaaS as MaaS Endpoint<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant VS as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Neo4j)
    participant Eval as RAGAS / Unitxt<br/>Evaluator
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS TLS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: RAG Experiment Optimization
        User->>Exp: Start experiment<br/>(documents, questions, search space)
        Exp->>S3: Fetch documents<br/>HTTPS / AWS IAM
        S3-->>Exp: Document corpus
        Exp->>Docling: Extract & chunk text<br/>(in-process)
        Docling-->>Exp: Structured chunks
        Exp->>MaaS: Generate embeddings<br/>HTTPS / API key
        MaaS-->>Exp: Embedding vectors
        Exp->>VS: Index chunks + vectors<br/>TLS / Token or Password
        loop HPO Trials
            HPO->>Exp: Next trial config
            Exp->>VS: Retrieve similar chunks<br/>TLS
            VS-->>Exp: Retrieved context
            Exp->>MaaS: LLM inference<br/>HTTPS / API key
            MaaS-->>Exp: Generated answer
            Exp->>Eval: Evaluate answer<br/>(in-process)
            Eval-->>Exp: Metric scores
            Exp->>HPO: Report score
        end
        Exp-->>User: Optimal RAG config
    end

    participant Client as External Client
    participant Auth as auth_wrapper<br/>8080/TCP
    participant API as FastAPI /v1/responses
    participant Agent as LangChain Agent
    participant K8s as K8s API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,K8s: Flow 2: Agentic RAG Inference (Starter Kit)
        Client->>Auth: POST /v1/responses<br/>Bearer token
        Auth->>K8s: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS / Bearer
        K8s-->>Auth: Token valid
        Auth->>API: Forward request
        API->>Agent: Invoke agent
        Agent->>Agent: Rewrite query
        Agent->>VS: Retrieve context<br/>TLS
        VS-->>Agent: Relevant chunks
        Agent->>MaaS: Generate response<br/>HTTPS / API key
        MaaS-->>Agent: LLM response
        Agent-->>API: Agentic answer
        API-->>Client: SSE stream response
    end
